{"id":"vod_md_2941","vodId":"2941","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"灼眼的夏娜第二季","name_cn":"灼眼的夏娜第二季","date":"2007-01-01","year":"2007","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"24集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230821-1/16a5def86f23bdf2d0da912c85b1fa0e.jpg"},"summary":"《灼眼的夏娜》TV第二季的故事将从小说第八卷开始讲起，以NDS游戏《灼眼的夏娜DS》中的登场人物，红世之徒，戏睡乡“メア”入侵御崎市开始开篇。据监督渡部高志所说，故事会对第一季的一些伏笔作出解释，并加入不少这个时代的小故事。第二季STAFF和声优会由原班人马担任，“钉宫之誓”依旧强势走高。夏天结束后，新学期开始了许多事物没有任何变化，但是同时也有不少事情逐渐发展着…池和吉田，绪方和田中之间产生了些许微妙的关系还有在我身旁，飘逸着长发的夏娜…但是，这一切似乎有着一丝奇怪的违何感在我们所不知道的地方，红世之徒再次展开了行动…","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-21 08:05:17","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230820/pXXGEUW6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230820/NyWWWHXv/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230820/TQGQdDdF/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230820/uoo0Imvu/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230820/5OCFqZXm/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230820/Lo8DgUdq/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230820/e1LPzJHr/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230820/aLxGJn4B/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230820/SFbAXf5H/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230820/EvA42fCo/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230820/LKeoy582/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230820/6wEKFSud/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230820/PSZQKFDv/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230820/eAUAmll3/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230820/a6qZrcg0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"http